      <description>&lt;p&gt;Here’s my first post.&#xA;Now I want to change something here to see if the &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;hard reset&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; of the local branch to match the remote has gone well.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;reset&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;--hard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;optional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;clean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;-fd&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;git clean -fd&lt;/strong&gt; removes all untracked files and directories from your working directory.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The listed folders (assets/, data/, i18n/, layouts/) were &lt;strong&gt;not tracked by git&lt;/strong&gt; (i.e., not part of any commit).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;After this, those folders are &lt;strong&gt;deleted locally&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/images/sky_quad.png&#34; alt=&#34;some quad sky image&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
